%e A396730 The upper zone contains the partitions of 6 and the lower zone contains the divisors of the numbers of the 6th row of the triangle A176206. Note that both zones contain the same numbers but in distinct order.
%e A396730 For k = 3 in the column 3 of the arrangement there are seven parts in the upper zone and there are four divisors in the lower zone. Therefore the total number of elements in the column 3 is 7 + 4 = 11, so T(6,3) = 11.
%Y A396730 Companion of A396731.
%Y A396730 Column 1 gives A000070, n >= 1.
%Y A396730 Leading diagonal gives A007395.
%Y A396730 Row sums give A211978, the convolution of A000005 and A139582, also the convolution of A000041 and A062011.
